  "solution": {
    "text": "The required plane passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />The required plane is parallel to <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />So, normal vector to the plane is <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />Equation of the required plane is<br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
